---
title: "What can happen to a requirement while its parent is open?"
accTitle: "Requirement lifecycle while parent is open"
accDescr: "An open requirement can be extracted or obsoleted, or wait for the parent close card. Independent completion is refused."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 14
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
flowchart TD
  OPEN["`**Open requirement**<br/>hidden checkbox`"]
  EXTRACT["`**Extract or split**<br/>sibling task plus stub`"]
  OBS["`**Obsolete**<br/>optional reason`"]
  CARD["`**Parent close card**<br/>Leave, extract, obsolete`"]
  REFUSE["`**Independent complete**<br/>refused`"]
  OPEN ==>|"parent Done"| CARD
  OPEN --> EXTRACT
  OPEN --> OBS
  OPEN -.->|"tick to [x]"| REFUSE
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef risk fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#C0392B,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#5F1414
  class OPEN focus
  class EXTRACT,OBS,CARD outcome
  class REFUSE risk
